conclusion: "At 6 km, a 20% longer secondary battery range (8.3 km to 9.96 km with Long-Range Secondary Battery Shells) shrinks vertical dispersion from 250.7 m to 233.2 m; horizontal is unchanged at 291 m. Manual Secondary Battery Aiming narrows both: horizontal 291 m to 261.9 m, vertical 250.7 m to 225.6 m."
